   "body": "Council",
   "motion": "that, in the event of an initial vote resulting in three or more candidates receiving votes, the City Recorder will pair off each of the tied candidates with another tied candidate. The City Recorder will assign each candidate a side of the coin prior to each coin toss. The City Recorder will flip a coin, and the candidate whose assigned side is facing up will advance while the other candidate is eliminated",
